  "goodToKnow": "Die Zulässigkeit is admissibility or permissibility. German law students learn that a court first checks a case's Zulässigkeit (is it admissible, filed correctly and on time?) and then its Begründetheit (is it well-founded?). Zulässig means permissible: die zulässige Höchstgeschwindigkeit (speed limit). From zulassen (to permit). It has no plural."
